On the 29th of January, 1999, best friends Laura Bible and Ashley Freeman had a sleepover at Ashley's house to celebrate her 16th birthday. Ashley's parents, Danny and Kathy Freeman were also at the house, located in Craig County, Oklahoma. About 6 a.m. the next morning, a neighbour reported that the Freeman house was on fire. Emergency services rushed to the scene and found the bodies of Kathy and Danny Freeman. However, Laura and Ashley were nowhere to be found. We covered this story very early on, way back in Case 3. All sorts of theories have emerged over the years. There was speculation Ashley and Laura might have murdered Danny and Kathy themselves. There were rumours that Danny was involved in drugs.
1999年1月29日，好朋友劳拉·拜布尔和阿什利·弗里曼在阿什利家过夜，庆祝她16岁生日。阿什利的父母丹尼和凯茜·弗里曼也在位于俄克拉何马州克雷格县的房子里。第二天早上6点左右，邻居报警称弗里曼家着火了。紧急服务人员赶到现场，发现了凯茜和丹尼·弗里曼的尸体。然而，劳拉和阿什利却不见踪影。我们在案情回顾第3期很早就报道了这个故事。多年来涌现出各种各样的猜测。有推测称阿什利和劳拉可能亲手谋杀丹尼和凯茜。还有传言称丹尼涉嫌毒品。

